cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "External Verification of WAF Enforcement Posture: Measuring Observable WAF Enforcement Beyond Presence Fingerprinting"
message: "If you use WAFstat in academic or professional work, please cite the accompanying white paper and this software artifact."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Tiago"
    family-names: "Kiill"
abstract: >-
  WAFstat is a lightweight external enforcement-verification tool for authorized WAF assessment. It reports externally observable enforcement consequences of a fixed marker corpus and does not claim WAF presence or private WAF internal state.
keywords:
  - web application firewall
  - WAF
  - external verification
  - enforcement posture
  - security measurement
license: MIT
version: "0.4.0"
